  "vv68:0.4": "4. Paṭhamaupassayadāyakavimānavatthu 1069. ",
  "vv68:1.1": "‘‘Cando yathā vigatavalāhake nabhe, ",
  "vv68:1.2": "obhāsayaṃ gacchati antalikkhe; ",
  "vv68:1.3": "Tathūpamaṃ tuyhamidaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv68:1.4": "obhāsayaṃ tiṭṭhati antalikkhe. ",
  "vv68:2.1": "1070. ‘‘Deviddhipattosi mahānubhāvā, ",
  "vv68:2.2": "manussabhūto kimakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv68:2.3": "Kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvo, ",
  "vv68:2.4": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv68:3.1": "1071. So devaputto attamano ",
  "vv68:3.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv68:3.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv68:4.1": "1072. ‘‘Ahañca bhariyā ca manussaloke, ",
  "vv68:4.2": "upassayaṃ arahato adamha; ",
  "vv68:4.3": "Annañca pānañca pasannacittā, ",
  "vv68:4.4": "sakkacca dānaṃ vipulaṃ adamha. ",
  "vv68:5.1": "1073. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv68:5.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv68:5.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv68:6.1": "Paṭhamaupassayadāyakavimānaṃ catutthaṃ. "
}
